      "## Why the claim file needs its own control",
      "A team working in outsourced billing operations can complete a task and still leave the next person unable to verify it. The control for the claim file exists to make the work reconstructable from a source, a decision, and a close. In outsourced medical billing operations, the claim file and denial appeal evidence stays with the case so the billing manager can verify what changed.",
