      "When two sources disagree, preserve both values and label the discrepancy. Do not overwrite the earlier value to make the report look clean. At the Outsourced Billing Services review, the billing manager compares this step with the claim file and denial appeal record before closing it.",
      "Close the loop with the person who raised the claim file issue. A record that is internally complete but never confirmed by the requester is only half closed. At the Outsourced Billing Services review, the billing manager compares this step with the claim file and denial appeal record before closing it.",
      "## Separate preparation from approval",
      "Name the owner before the VA prepares any action. The VA may collect, compare, label, calculate, and route; the billing manager decides whether the evidence is enough. This claim file and denial appeal step is logged for the Outsourced Billing Services team and reviewed by the billing manager at the next checkpoint.",
